control_cli_events {"model": "gpt-6-luna", "events": "{\"type\":\"thread.started\",\"thread_id\":\"01a16780-6bc8-73c2-a2a4-d124fcc7ee36\"}\n{\"type\":\"turn.started\"}\n{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_0\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"{\\\"task_summary\\\":\\\"Implement a public permutation API in solution.py and add standard-library unittest coverage in test_solution.py, following the stated behavior and constraints.\\\",\\\"constraints\\\":[\\\"Work only in the supplied task workspace; do not access parent repositories or external services.\\\",\\\"Use Python 3.11+ and the standard library.\\\",\\\"Return all distinct permutations of input characters in sorted lexicographic order; the empty string has one permutation, the empty string.\\\",\\\"Inputs contain at most seven characters.\\\",\\\"Maintain type hints and do not mutate input collections.\\\",\\\"No algorithmic complexity constraint is imposed.\\\",\\\"test_solution.py must contain at least two passing unittest methods exercising the public API and cover ordinary, boundary, and empty inputs, or invalid numeric inputs if no collection is accepted.\\\",\\\"Retain all stated behavior and compatibility requirements.\\\"],\\\"success_criteria\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SC-1\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"solution.py exists in the workspace.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_exists\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"solution.py\\\"}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SC-2\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"test_solution.py exists in the workspace.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_exists\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"test_solution.py\\\"}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SC-3\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The solution module compiles.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"command\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m py_compile solution.py\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SC-4\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The unittest suite passes using the requested discovery command.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"command\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m unittest discover -v\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SC-5\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The public API returns distinct permutations in sorted lexicographic order, handles empty input as one empty permutation, and the tests cover these behaviors with at least two unittest methods.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"llm_judge\\\",\\\"rubric\\\":\\\"Read solution.py and test_solution.py. Determine whether the public API returns all distinct permutations of characters in sorted lexicographic order, including exactly one empty-string permutation for empty input, and whether test_solution.py contains at least two standard-library unittest methods that exercise the public API across ordinary, boundary, and empty inputs. Judge only what is visible in these files; do not infer results from execution.\\\"}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SC-6\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The implementation maintains type hints and does not mutate input collections.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"llm_judge\\\",\\\"rubric\\\":\\\"Read solution.py. Assess whether the public implementation maintains type hints and avoids mutating input collections. Judge only code visible in the file.\\\"}}],\\\"verification\\\":[{\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m py_compile solution.py\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m unittest discover -v\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}}],\\\"stop_conditions\\\":[],\\\"assumptions\\\":[\\\"The named files are interpreted as relative paths in the supplied task workspace; solution.py and test_solution.py may not exist yet and may be created.\\\",\\\"The request does not specify the public function name or exact API signature; the implementation and tests will need to agree on an API choice consistent with the stated permutation behavior.\\\",\\\"The requested unittest discovery command is assumed to discover test_solution.py from the workspace root.\\\"]}\"}}\n{\"type\":\"turn.completed\",\